{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんはー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前のBlogのコメント全部読みました!\nこんなに素敵なファンの皆さんがいてくださっているから続けられるんだなぁ。\nと、力がどんどんみなぎってきました!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからも、桜井玲香をよろしくお願いします!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ、2013年始めの幕張全握・個握\n今回もたくさんの方が足を運んでくださり\n無事に終了しました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"参加してくださった皆様\nありがとうございました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私事で延期させて頂いていた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「似顔絵会」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は昨日、お昼休憩の時にお時間を頂いて描かせていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画力が破滅的にない私の絵。\nやっぱり上手に描けなかった...；\n本当に申し訳ありませんでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえば前、乃木どこで絵を披露したことあったんだよなー。\nスフィンクスとか色々..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかして皆さん見たことあったりしますか；??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の画力が乏しい事、既に皆さん知っているのかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"............それちょっと困る"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また機会がある時にリベンジしたいです..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日のお洋服"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"rosebulletの黒のミニワンピにしました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肩の部分がシースルーになってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いでしょ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"?\nお気に入りなんです!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、髪型変えました★\nずっと悩んでいた前髪。\nやっぱり切っちゃったよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幼くなったな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、まりかよりは大人だも〜ん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週の握手はどうしようかな??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/01/07/6235764/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"３部だけツインしてみたけど、\n恥ずかしすぎたからもうしません。。"}],"source":"archive"}